# SKID KIDS: NOODLE (Jerry's kit). His throws wiggle as they slide; his
# special throw is the COMET (faster, farther, a much bigger hit); his move
# is the STOMP (the other team, on the floor, falls down; no point).
game skidkids
wait 5
cheat match 0 1 3 11 0
cheat coach 0
cheat clearbags
cheat freeze 1
cheat freeze 2
cheat freeze 3
cheat play
expect who0 == 0
cheat kid 0 100 100
cheat kid 2 280 60
cheat kid 3 280 170
cheat give 0 1
hold B 40
wait 6
waituntil bagy0 > 104 30
waituntil bagy0 < 96 30
# the comet: eight pixels off the line still hits
cheat clearbags
cheat kid 2 230 108
cheat stars 0 2
cheat give 0 1
hold B 70
wait 2
expect bagkind0 == 1
waituntil score0 == 1 60
expect kst2 == 5
# the stomp: the kid in the air is spared
waituntil kst2 == 0 100
cheat thaw 3
cheat stars 0 2
press A
wait 4
press A
expect n_smove == 1
expect kst2 == 5
expect score0 == 1
